    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hypnotic EDM arena as a lone sphere, dodging relentless waves of enemy orbs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >across a color-shifting stage that responds with synced pulses to thumping electronic beats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The platform spins, the music surges, and your reflexes are the only way to survive the beat-driven chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s pure reflex. Pure rhythm. Pure chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hypnotic EDM arena as a lone sphere, dodging relentless waves of enemy orbs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >across a color-shifting stage that responds with synced pulses to thumping electronic beats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The platform spins, the music surges, and your reflexes are the only way to survive the beat-driven chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s pure reflex. Pure rhythm. Pure chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced, reflex-driven action arcade game set in a music-reactive arena. Survive 90 seconds of pure reflex in a neon-lit arena pulsing to EDM energy. Dodge waves of enemy orbs as the platform spins, the visuals pulse, and the chaos escalates. One hit and it\u2019s over.",
